{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603010/extras/HeadAboutV02.png?t=1745257272\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two cats, a ball of yarn, and a duel full of jumps, swipes, and fun. In Pungo, every match is a battle of reflexes where you can challenge a friend or test your skills against emerging opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use surprising power-ups to change the course of the match, from classic abilities to unexpected effects that will put your feline dexterity to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock and collect a wide variety of adorable cats, each with its own style, and play in charming scenarios. Will you be the fastest and most agile cat with the yarn ball?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kick, headbutt, or belly-flop onto the ball of yarn, challenge your friends, and have fun in Pungo!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3603010?t=1745257272","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603010/d0f55e6fec2fc46475e54cb935f0c25093ad0355/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745257272","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603010/116c66536bd0f4aea2786c4687a30f0b2f4e576d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745257272","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603010/116c66536bd0f4aea2786c4687a30f0b2f4e576d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745257272","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_suppor